<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nehe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Ezra na Nehemia shitakulira wantu wa Israeli ntambu yawajimiluwiti kuwuya Israeli, kwanja pawaweriti watolwa lopola kugenda kuuajemi na Babeli. Nehemia kaliholiti ntambu ya kunyawa kayi shibambaza kuguzyengeta mji gwa Yerusalamu. Wantu yawamana lagiru wavimaniti kuwera Ezra kalembiti na kujojonira ntambiru za shitabu sha 1 na 2 sha mirandu ya shaka na sha Ezra na Nehemia, handa ndiri Ezra mekaweri yumonga yakalembiti vitabu vya Nehemia, shiperiti kwanjira pakwegera na vinja miya msheshi na selasini pamberi pa kwiwuka kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemia kaweriti ntumintumi gwa kujega shakulanda sha Aritashasta mfalumi gwa uajemi, Nehemia kamluwiti Aritashasta kamjimiri kawuyi Yerusalemu kwa utanga toziya ya kunyawa kayi shibambaza sha mji gwa Yerusalemu. Aritashasta kamjimiliriti Nehemia kutenda hangu na kamsyaguliti Nehemia kaweli mkulu gwa Yuda na miji yaizyengeta Yerusalemu shipandi sha 5:14 tembera wantu wamonga wajeriti kumlewelera Nehemia nakanyawa kayi shibambaza sha Yerusalemu, kumbiti lihengu ali lipeliti mumashaka ga hamsini na mbili kwa utanga wa Mlungu. Kayi Ezra kamtangiti Nehemia kukolamlima wantu wa Israeli su kutenda kayi lipatanu lyawu na Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweraamu ga Shitabu sha Nehemia</para>
  <para style="io">Nehemia ntambu yakanyawiti Yerusalemu na kulonguziya lihengu lya kunyawa kayi shibambaza sha Yerusalemu. Shipandi sha kwanja mpaka sha sita.</para>
  <para style="io">Waisraeli ntambu wanjiti kulikala Yerusalemu na kulikola lagiru lya Mlungu. Shipandi sha saba mpaka sha kumi na tatu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Avi ndo visoweru vya Nehemia, mwana gwa Hakalia.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="NEH 1:1">Lihengu lya Nehemia ku Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Paweriti mumji mkulu gwa Susa, mumwezi gwa Kislevu gwa shinja sha ishilini sha ukolamlima wa Atashasita <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani, yumu gwa walongu wangu, kiziti pamuhera na wamu wa wantu kulawa muisi ya Yuda. Niwakosiya kuusu Wayahudi wayetu yawaponikiti, weni yawawuyiti kulawa Babuloni viraa na mji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Womberi wanankula, wayahudi yawaponekiti na kuuya muisi yawu, vinu wamuntabiku nkulu na wamsoni. “Shibambaza sha mji gwa Yerusalemu shibomuluwa na migomi mikulu yakuyi ilunguziwa.” <verse eid="NEH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Pampikaniriti aga nilivagiti pasi na kulira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:4">Ndayiti kwa mashaka tunga. Noyiti kuliya na kumluwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi, <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />shakapanu nonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa kumpindi, gwee Mlungu yaguwera mkulu na kutiliziya, gulikola lipatanu lyaku na kulanguziya ufiru yawuwerandiri na upereru kwa wantu walii yawajimira lagiru zaku. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Gundoli na gupikinili maluwa gangu neni ntumintumi gwaku, panikuluwa pashiru na paluwala toziya ya wantumintumi waku, wantu awa Israeli. Gutulekiziyiti vidoda vyetu twenga wantu wa Israeli, vyatutenditi kulongolu kwaku. Neni pamuhera na wantu wa kaya ya tati gwangu tujimila kuwera tutenda vidoda. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Tutenda makontola ng'anji kulongolu kwaku, tuzikolandiri lagiru zaku na malagalira gaku gagutupananiti twenga kupitila ntumintumi gwaku Musa. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Shondi guliholi shilii shagumgambiliti ntumintumi gwaku Musa, pagulongiti, handa pamusigalandiri kuwera waminika kwaneni, haniwapalasiyi muwamu mwa maisi. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Kumbiti pamumbuyira neni na kuzikola lagiru zangu na kuzijimira, hangu wantu waku yawaweriti mukuhamisiwa kutali nentu muupeleru wa pasipanu, haniwajojoniri kulawa aku na kuwawuziya pahala palii panipasyaguliti paweri pahala pangu pa kunguwira,”<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Mtuwa awa ndo wantumintumi waku na wantu waku yaguwalopoliti kwa uwezu waku mkulu na kwa liwoku lyaku lyana makakala. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Gwee Mtuwa, gundoli na gupikinili maluwa ga ntumintumi gwaku na ga wantumintumi waku yawanemelera kukupanana ligoya. Nikuluwa guntendeli mirandu yangu igendi weri neni ntumintumi gwaku na monerwi lusungu na mfalumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Mumashaka aga neni weriti na lihengu lya kumjegera mfalumi shakulanda.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kankugenda Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Mumwezi yagushemwa Nisani na shinja sha ishilini sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Aritashasita, shaka divayi payiweliti kulongolu kwakuyi, ntoliti divayi ilii nimpanana, mfalumi kamonitindiri kuwera nana hinginika handa shaka ali. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Hangu Mfalumi Aritashasita kankosiya, “Ntambu gaa sheni shaku shiwoneka shana hinginika, gwenga gulwala ndiri? Mona gwinginika nentu mumoyu mwaku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Ndo pantiriti nentu. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Nimwankula, “Gwee mfalumi, gulikali mashaka goseri! Sheni shangu hashileki hashi kuwera na hinginika, shaka aku kumji gwa Yerusalemu yagawela masembi ga wambuyi wangu, mahami na migomi mikulu yakuyi ilunguziwa kwa motu?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Mfalumi Aritashasita kang'ambira, “Vinu gufira nikutenderi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Palapalii nduwa mumoyu mwangu kwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Shakapanu nimgambira mfalumi, “Gwee mfalumi, payiwera gufiliziwa na neni na handa panjimiruwa kulongolu kwaku, nikuluwa guntumi ng'endi Yuda kumji gwa masembi ga wambuyi wangu su nigunyawi kayi.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Nayomberi mfalumi kankosiya agawu mdala gwakuyi pakawera pakwegera na yomberi, “Haguweri aku kwa shaka gaa na haguwuyi panu ndii?” Hangu mfalumi kandeka mbuki na neni nimgambira hambuyi ndii.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Viravilii, “Nimgambira mfalumi handa ikuherepera, nduwa mpananwi hamba su nizijegi kwa wakolamlima wa kumwambu mwa lushemba Eufurate su wanjimili mpiti mpaka muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Viravilii nikuluwa gumlemberi luhamba Asafu mlolera gwa lidowi lya shifalumi su kampanani mbawu za kunyawira shizingiti mbawu zakunyawira migomi ya liboma lya numba nkulu ya Mlungu na mbawu za kunyawira shibambaza sha mji na numba yangu yanfilakulikala.” Mfalumi kajimira luwa yangu toziya Mlungu kaweliti pamuhera na neni.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Mfalumi kaweriti kantuma pamuhera na wakulu wa mashonta na wakwena farasi. Su ng'enditi kwa wakulu wa isi za kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati, niwapananiti hamba za mfalumi. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Kumbiti Sanibalati yakalawa mji gwa Horoni na Tobia mlonguziya gwa wantu wa Waamoni na ntumintumi gwakuyi, pawapikiniliti kuwera niza su kutenda mlandu muheri kwa wantu wa Israeli, wanemeleritindiri mirandu ayi.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Hangu nsokiti Yerusalemu, nilikaliti aku kwa mashaka matatu, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />su mbukiti pashiru, Neni pamuhela na wantu wadidini, nimgambirandiri muntu yoseri galii geni Mlungu kaweriti kagatula mumoyu mwa neni toziya ya mji gwa Yerusalemu. Nimtola ndiri shigongolu yoseri ila punda hera yanimkweniti namweni. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Ndawiti kunja pashiru kupitira ligomi likulu lya kululalanda nfata njira yayigenda kulinegu lyalishemwa lya Njoka na Ligomi likulu lya kulifunkusi, nivikaguliti vibambaza vya Yerusalemu vyavibomolitwi na magomi gakuyi geni yagaweriti galunguziwa kwa motu. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Shakapanu mpita kuligomi likulu lya mbwiru na kulitanda lya mfalumi. Punda kasinditi kupita toziya ya limatiru. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Pashiru palii, mpitiriti kululalanda na kulolera shibambaza sha mji. Mbuyiriti kayi kupitira Ligomi likulu lwa lulalanda.<verse eid="NEH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Wakulu wavimanitindiri pahala pang'enditi pota shantenditi. Kayi weriti niwagambirandiri Wayahudi, watambika, walonguziya, wakulu pota wantu walii weni mewalitendi lihengu lwa kugunyawa kayi mji.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Shakapanu niwagambiriti, “Muwona ntambu yatutabika! Na mwona Yerusalemu ndo mahami na migomi mikulu yakuyi ilunguziwa kwa motu. Mwizi vinu tushinyawi kayi shibambaza sha Yerusalemu su natuwera kayi msoni.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Niwagambira Mlungu ntambu yakantendiriti maheri na shili mfalumi shakantendiriti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Wanankula, “Aya! Na twanji kunyawa kayi.” Hangu na womberi wanja lihengu ali liheri.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Kumbiti Sanibalati na Horoni na Tobiya gwa likabila lya Amoni na Geshemu muntu gwa likabila lya Arabu, pawapikaniriti, watusekiti na watujongera na kutubolera pawalonga, “Ndo shintu gaa ashi shamshitenda? Hashi, mumugalambuki mfalumi?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Niwankula, “Mlungu gwa kumpindi hakatutangi tuwezi kutenda lihengu ali na twenga yatuwera wantumintumi wakuyi hatwanji kunyawa kayi. Kumbiti mwenga mwahela shenu pota shamfiruwa kupananwa mu Yerusalemu pota shintu sha kuholwa.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Shibambaza sha Vibambaza vya Yerusalemu vyankunyawiwa kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Su Ligomi lya wakondolu linyawitwi kayi na Eliyashibu, mtambika mkulu, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi yawaweriti watambika. Walituliti kulongolu kwa Mlungu na kutulwa migomi yakuyi na wendereyiti kunyawa mpaka shindwalingu sha miya yimu na viraavirii washilumikiti na kushinyawa kayi mpaka pashiweriti shindwalingu sha Hananeli.<verse eid="NEH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Pahala yapafatiti panyawitwi na wantu wa Yeriku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:2">Pawapeleriti wantu wa Yeriku Zakuri mwana gwa Imri kanyawiti shimbambaza.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Ligomi lya Somba linyawitwi kayi na lukolu lwa Hasena, watula vizingiti vyakuyi, migomi, misumali mikulu na ngwiligiziwu za shuma.<verse eid="NEH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Pawapeleriti awa kanyawiti Meremoti mwana gwa Uri na mzukulu gwa Hakosi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Pakapeleriti Merimoti kanyawiti Meshulamu mwana gwa Berekiya, mzukulu gwa Meshezabeli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Pakapeleriti Meshulamu, kanyawiti Zadoki, mwana gwa Baana.<verse eid="NEH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Pakapeleriti Zadoki wanyawiti wantu kulawa mji gwa Tekowa. Kumbiti wakulu wawu walemiti kutenda lihengu lyawapananitwi na wakulu wawu.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Ligomi likulu lyalishemwa lya makashu linyawitwi kayi na Yoyada mwana gwa Paseya na Meshulamu mwana gwa Besodeya, watula vizingiti vyakuyi na migomi na misumali mikulu na ngwiligiziwu za shuma.<verse eid="NEH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Pawapeleriti awa, wanyawiti kayi Melatia yakalawiriti mji gwa Gibeyoni na Yadoni yakalawiriti mji gwa Mmeronoti pamuhera na wantu wa mji gwa Gibeyoni na Mizipa mlongoziwa na mkulu yakaweriti kalikala kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati.<verse eid="NEH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Pawapeleriti awa, kanyawiti Uziyeli mwana gwa Harihaya, yumu gwa mafundi wa zahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:8">Pakapeleriti Uziyeli, kanyawiti kayi Hanania yumu gwa wanyawa wa utuli. Wanyawiti Yerusalemu mpaka kusoka shibambaza shipana.<verse eid="NEH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Refaya mwana gwa Huri ayu kaweriti mkulu gwa nusu ya mji gwa Yerusalemu. Kanyawiti kayi mji yagufata.<verse eid="NEH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Yedaya mwana gwa Hurumafu kanyawiti shipandi shashiweriti pakwegera na numba yakuyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:10">Pakapeleriti Yedaya, kanyawiti kayi Hatushi mwana gwa Hashabineya.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Pa Hatushi, kanyawiti kayi Malikiya mwana gwa Harimu na Hashubu mwana gwa Pahati Mowabu wanyawiti kayi pahala pamonga na shindwalingu sha litanuli lya koshiya mabumunda.<verse eid="NEH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Pawapeleriti awa, kanyawiti kayi Shalumu mwana gwa Haloheshi, mkolamlima gwa nusu ya mji gwa Yerusalemu. Yomberi Kanyawiti kayi pamuhera na wahinga wakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Ligomi likulu lya kululalanda linyawitwi kayi na Hanuni pamuhera na wenikaya wa mji gwa Zanoa. Wayitula migomi na misumali mikulu na ngwiligiziwu za shuma. Washinyawitwi kayi shibambaza shana utali handa wa mita miya msheshi mpaka kwaliweriti ligomi likulu lya lifunkusi.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Ligomi likulu lya Lifunkusi linyawitwi kayi na Malikiya, mwana gwa Rekabu, mkolamlima gwa mji gwa Beti Hakeremu. Kanyawiti kayi na Kayitula migomi mikulu na misumali mikulu na ngwiligiziwu za shuma.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Ligomi lya mbwiru linyawitwi kayi na Shalumu mwana gwa Kolihoze na mkulu gwa mji gwa Mizipa. Kanyawiti na kutima pahala pakwingilira, kalitula ligomi na misumali mikulu na ngwiligiziwu za shuma. Na kanyawa shimbambaza sha litanda lya Shela lyaliwera pakwegera na shiwunga sha shifalumi mpaka nkweneru yaziseleriti kulawa mji gwa mfalumi Dawudi.<verse eid="NEH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Pahala papafatiti kapanyawiti kayi Nehemia mwana gwa Azibuki, mkolamlima gwa nusu ya mji gwa Beti Zuri na kanyawiti kayi kusoka pakwegera na masembi ga Dawudi, mpaka kulitanda lyalinyawitwi na kusoka numba ya wamashonta.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi yawanyawiti shibambaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Pakapeleriti Nehemia, wiziti Walawi kunyawa kayi shimbambaza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:17">Rehumu mwana gwa Bani. Ndo Yakafatiti</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:17">Hashabiya mkolamlima gwa nusu ya mji gwa Keila, yomberi kanyawiti kayi shimbambaza toziya ya wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Pakapelela Hashabia, unyawa utenditwi na walongu wawu pawalongoziwa na Binui, mwana gwa Henadadi, mkulu gwa nusu ya mji gwa Keila.<verse eid="NEH 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Shakapanu Ezeri mwana gwa Yeshua, mkulu gwa Mizipa, kanyawiti kayi pahala pamonga, pashidunda shashilolana na numba ya kutulira vintu vya kulikomangira kunkondu, mpaka pashisoku sha shibambaza.<verse eid="NEH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Baruki mwana gwa Zabai kanyawiti kayi pahala pamonga kwanjira kushisoku sha shimbambaza shilii mpaka kuligomi lya numba ya Eliashibu mtambika mkulu.<verse eid="NEH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Meremoti mwana gwa Uriya na mzukulu gwa Hakosi, kanyawiti kayi pahala pamonga, kulawa kuligomi lya numba ya Eliyashibu mpaka upeleru wakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika yawanyawiti shibambaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Pakapeleriti Melemoti, wanyawiti kayi Watambika yawakaliti pahala pakwegera na mji gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Pawapeleriti womberi, Benjamini na Hashubu wanyawiti kayi pahala papalolana na numba yawu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Pawapeleriti awa Azariya mwana gwa Manaseya na mzukulu gwa Ananiya, kanyawiti kayi pahala yapalilolana na numba yawu.<verse eid="NEH 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Pakapeleriti Azaria, Binui mwana gwa Henadadi kanyawiti kayi pahala pamonga, kanjira kunumba ya Azariya mpaka kushisoku sha shibambaza,<verse eid="NEH 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />yapafatiti panyawitwi na Palali mwana gwa Uziya kanyawiti kayi pahala yapasigaliti pakwegera na shisoku sha shibambaza mpaka kushindwalingu panumba ya pampindi ya mfalumi pakwegera na luwaga lya walolera. Pahala pamonga kanyawiti kayi;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:25">Pedaya mwana gwa Paroshi, <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />kwa kutangwa na wantumintumi wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yawalikala pashigongu sha Ofeli, wanyawiti kayi pahala papalolana na ligomi la mashi, lyaliwera kwagulawa mshenji na pahala pa shindwalingu shashilawira pampindi.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanyawa wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Pawapeleriti awa, Wantu wa Tekoa wapanyawiti kayi pahala papili, papalolana na shindwalingu shikulu shitali mpaka pashiweriti shibambaza sha Ofeli.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Watambika watenditi manyawa ga ligomi lya Farasi, kila yumu kanyawiti pahala yapalolana na numba yakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Pa womberi, Sadoki mwana gwa Imeri kanyawiti kayi pahala papalolana na numba yakuyi. Na Pakapeleriti yomberi kanyawiti kayi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:29">Shemaya mwana gwa Shekaniya, mlolela gwa ligomi likulu lya kwagulawa mshenji.<verse eid="NEH 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Pakapeleriti Shemaya, Hanania mwana gwa Shelemia na Hanuni mwana gwa sita gwa Zalafu, wanyawiti kayi pahala papili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:30">Shakapanu Meshulamu mwana gwa Berekia, kanyawiti kayi pahala yapaweriti palolana na numba yakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Pakapeleriti Meshulamu Malikia, yumu gwa wanyawa zahabu, kanyawiti kayi pahala mpaka kunumba za wantumintumi wa Mlungu na ya washuwuzi yayilolana na Ligomi lya ukagula, mpaka kushumba yashiwera pampindi pashisoku.<verse eid="NEH 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Wanyawa zahabu na washuwuzi wanyawiti kulawa kushumba shashiweriti kushisoku mpaka ku Ligomi likulu lya Kondolu.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kakuwakanka wasingani wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati pakapikaniriti handa twenga wayahudi twanja lihengu lya kunyawa kayi shibambaza, kakalaliti nentu na kawera na utama, kuwajongera wayahudi, <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />kulongolu kwa waganja wakuyi na wamashonta wa Wasamalia, pakalonga, “Wayahudi awa wayongi wankutenda shishi? Hashi, hawashinyawi kayi shibambaza ashi? Hashi, hawalaviyi tambiku na kuweza kumalira kunyawa kwa lishaka limu? Hashi, hawawezi kugafukula mabuwi kulawa mulimatiru lya yavilunguziwitwi kwa motu su kunyawira?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobia muntu gwa isi ya Amoni, yakaweliti kagolokera pakwegera na yomberi kakamaliti pakalonga, “Wankuyawa shishi? Shibweta pakapita pampindi pakuyi, hakabomoli shibambaza shawu sha mabuwi!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Ndo nimluwa Mlungu panonga, gwee Mlungu gwetu, gupikanili ntambu yawatujongera, guwawuziliri jongera zawu weni na guwaleki wabatwi na kutolwa lopola muisi ya umanda. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Nakaka naguwalekiziya makontola gawu na vidoda vyawu, toziya wakukaliziya kulongolu kwa wanyawa.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Kumbiti twendereyiti na unyawa wa shibambaza mpaka shisoka nusu yakuyi kugenda kumpindi, toziya wantu waweriti wangutenda lihengu kwa moyu gwawu goseri.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Hangu Sanibalati na Tobia na wantu wa Arabu na Waamoni na Waashidodi pawapikaniriti kuwera lihengu lya kunyawa kayi shibambaza sha Yerusalemu liweriti wakwendereya weri na handa mwamubomokiti mushibambaza mwankudiwiwa, womberi wakalaliti nentu. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Woseri wajimiraniti pamuhera kwiza kulikomanga aku Yerusalemu na kutenda wantu walikomangi. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Hangu tumluwiti Mlungu gwetu na tutuliti walolela kwajili ya kugulolera mji, pashiru na palwala.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Wantu wa Yuda waweriti na lwimbu lwa kwimba hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">“Makakala ga watenda lihengu gapunguwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">Na kwana limatiru livuwa lya kuwusiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">Na hatunyawi hashi shibambaza ashi.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Na wankondu wetu walonga, “Hapeni wavimani pota kuwona, mpaka twenga patuwasokera womberi na kuwalaga na kugolosiya lihengu lyawu.” <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Shakapanu Wayahudi yawalikala muwamu mwa wankondu wetu pawapikaniliti visoweru vyawu, watwizira mala kwa mala kutubeliziya, “Hawalawili kila uwega kutukomanga.” <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Hangu, ntula wantu pahala pa pasi pa shimbambaza na pahala pa kumbeli pa shimbambaza peni penimalilirwi kunyawiwa, ntula wantu waloleri kulinganira na nkolu pawawera na magumba gawu, migoha na pindi zawu.<verse eid="NEH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Pamoniti kuwera wantu waweriti na lyoga niwagambira wakulu na walonguziya na wantu woseri, “Namuwatila. Mumholi Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkulu na gwa kutiliziya, mlikomangili toziya ya walongu wetu na wana wetu na wahinga wenu na wadala wenu na kaya zyenu.” <verse eid="NEH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Wankondu wetu pawapikaniriti handa tuvimana shilii shawafira kututendera na handa Mlungu kawavuluvutira, hangu twawoseri tuwuyiti na kila yumu kendereyiti na lihengu lyakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kulawa lishaka ali na kwendeleya, nusu ya wantu wangu wawera wankwendereya na unyawa wa shibambaza, nusu imonga iwera wamuulolera pawawera na migowa yawu na pindi na kuvala nguwu za kulishinga shifuwa. Wakulu wetu waweriti wankuwatanga wantu wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Wantu yawaweriti wangunyawa shibambaza na wantu walii yawaweliti wangupapa vintu vya unyawa wendereyiti na lihengu lyawu agawu liwoku limu likola vintu vya unyawa na liwoku limonga likola shintu shakuyi sha kulikomangira. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Kila mnyawa kalitawa ligumba lyakuyi mushunu mwakuyi agawu pakendeleya na lihengu. Kumbiti muntu gwa kugomba lipenka kalikaliti pakwegera na neni. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Niwagambira wakulu na walonguziya na wantu woseri, “Lihengu ali ndo likulu na twenga kila muntu ka kutali na myaguyi pawatenda lihengu lya kunyawa shibambaza. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Paguwera pahala poseri pagutenda lihengu, katepu pagupikanira lipenka, Gutugili kwatuwera twenga. Mlungu gwetu hakatukomangiri.” <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Hangu, twendereyiti kutenda lihengu lyetu na nusu ya wantu pawakola vintu vya kulikomangira kwanjila mandawira mpaka pakwinaliti.<verse eid="NEH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Shaka ashi niwagambiriti wantu, “Kila muntu na ntumintumi gwakuyi walikali ku Yerusalemu su pashiru waweri walolera wetu na paluwala waweri wankutenda lihengu.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Neni na walongu wangu na wantumintumi wangu na walolela yawaweriti pamuhera na neni tuvulandiri nguwu zyetu. Kila yumu kaweriti na vintu vyakuyi vya kulikomangira, ata pakagenditi kudidibula mashi.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia kankuwatanga wahushu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Shaka ashi wapalu na wadala wawu walira nentu kwajili ya walongu wawu Wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Wamu walongiti, “Twenga na wana wetu wapalu na wahinga twawavuwa, su mtupanani shiboga, tulii na twendereyi kulikala.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Wamonga walongiti, “Tugatula poni malambu getu, malambu ga mizabibu na numba zyetu su tupati viboga shaka ashi sha njala nkulu.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Viravilii kuweriti na wamonga yawaweriti walonga, “Tutoliti uwanda su kulipa kodi kwa mfalumi toziya ya malambu getu na malambu ga mizabibu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Kumbiti twenga twateratera na Wayahudi wamonga na wana wetu ndo wana wawu. Hangu, twankuwakakanika wana wetu waweri wamanda na wamu wa wahinga wetu wawera kala wamanda. Twahera uwezu wa kulewelera mlandu agu toziya malambu ga twenga na malambu getu ga mizabibu gapokwa kwa makakala na wantu wamonga.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Pampikaniliti kulira kwawu na malalamiku aga, nkalaliti nentu. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Nilihola mumahala gangu na kuwashema wakulu na walonguziya. Niwagambira, “Mwankuwatabisiya walongu wetu kwa kuwatola shilii shashongeleka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">Shakapanu niwashema wantu woseri pamuhera su niwatakuli. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Niwatakula hangu, “Tutenda ntambu yatuweza na tuwakombola walongu wetu Wayahudi yawaweriti washuwuzwa kwa maisi gamonga. Kumbiti vinu mwankuwashuwuza kayi walongu wenu, su twenga twawahemeri!” Womberi wanyamaliti jii, toziya weniti ndiri na shoseri sha kutakula.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Su nendereya kuwagambira, “Shamushitenda ndo shidoda, hashi mfiruwandiri mwenga kumjimira Mlungu na kumtendera maheri, su natusekwa na wankondu wetu wantu yawawerandiri wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Neni na walongu wangu na wantu wangu twankuwazimira wantu mpiya na viboga. Hangu tuleki kutola shashongereka. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Muwawuziliri kalongola malambu gawu na malambu gawu ga mizabibu na malambu gawu ga mizeyituni na numba zawu, viraa riba ya mia yamtola mumpya na viboga na divayi yasyayi na lipaki lya mizeyituni.” <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Womberi witikira na kulonga, “Hatuwawuziliri na hapeni tuwashongi shoseri. Hatutendi ntambu yagulongiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Shakapanu niwashema watambika wakulu woseri, walilapa kulongolu kwa wakulu na watambika kutenda ntambu yawalongiti. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Shakapanu mpunta lufunga lwaluweriti mushunu shangu na kulonga, “Mlungu kampunti ntambu iraa kila muntu na numba yakuyi na lihengu lyakuyi, yanakaleki kutenda shilii Shatujimiraniti. Hangu kampuntwi na kalikali kahera shintu nakamu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Na lijojoniru lyoseri lijimira, “Yina.” Kamzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu. Wantu watenda ntambu yawalongiti.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uheri wa Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kwanjira shaka ashi, Pasyagulitwi kuwera mkolamlima gwa isi ya Yuda kwa vinja lilongu na mbili kwanjira shinja sha selasini na mbili sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Aritashasta, neni pamuhera na walongu wangu tuliyandiri shiboga sheni shakaliyiti mkolamlima. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Wakolamlima yawalongoleriti waweriti shisanka shizotopa kwa wantu wafiriti wantu wawapanani viboga na divayi, wawafiriti walaviyi vipandi alubaini vya madini ga feza. Ata wantumintumi wawu wawatabisiyiti wantu. Kumbiti neni ntendandiri hangu, toziya nimtiriti Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Nililaviya mulihengu lya kunyawa kayi shibambaza ashi na nilipanana ndiri ata lirambu. Ata wantumintumi wangu woseri wajojonikiti toziya ya lihengu. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Nentu ya aga, neni ndiyiti pamuhera na Wayahudi miya yimu na hamsini na wakulu na walii yawatwiziliti kulawa maisi gapakwegera na twenga. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Kila lishaka, su kuwaliyiziya wantu awa, niwalikitula ng'ombi shipalu yumu na kondolu sita waherepa na nkuku. Pagapita mashaka lilongu ndaviyiti divayi ya kila ntambu. Kumbiti neni nemiti wantu wampanani shiboga sha mfalumi toziya nivimaniti wantu wakakanikitwi kulaviya vintu.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Vinu, gwee Mlungu gwangu, guliholi maheri gangu goseri ganiwatenderiti wantu awa.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa kumlaga Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Shakapanu Sanibalati na Tobiya na Geshemu muntu gwa Arabu na wankondu watwenga wamonga, pawapikaniriti kuwera malira kushinyawa kayi shibambaza na kwahera pahala patupalekiti tembera mashaka aga nenetuli migomi pahala pa kwingilira. <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu wanjegeriti ulagilagi awu, “Mwizi tuliwoni mushijiji shashiwera mululalanda lwa Ono. Kumbiti wafiliti kuntenda.” <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Neni niwatumiti walagilagi kwa womberi nakuwagambira, “Lihengu lyanilitenda ndo lya mana nentu hapeni nizi. Hashi ndeki lihengu ligoloki nizi kwa mwenga?”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Wendereyiti kunjegera ulagilagi ulaulii mala msheshi, kumbiti neni niwapananiti lyankulu lilalilii.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Vilavilii Sanibalati kamlagaliriti ntumintumi gwakuyi kwa neni mala ya mhanu agawu kanjegera luhamba lwa lupala hera lwaluweza kubetulwa na muntu yoseri, <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />na lweni lulembitwi hangu,</para>
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 6:6">“Kwana visoweru vyavyendeleya kulipalasiya muisi ya pakwegera na Geshumu kavijimira visoweru avi, kuwera gwenga pamuhera na Wayahudi wayagu mfira kutugalambuka. Hangu mwankunyawa kayi shibambaza su gwenga gufira guweri mfalumi gwawu. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Gwenga gutura watambika Yerusalemu su wabweri visoweru vyaku kuwera kwana mfalumi muisi ya Yuda. Shisoweru ashi hakagambirwi mfalumi Aritashasta. Hangu gwizi tuliwoni na kuyowelera mirandu ayi.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Na neni nimjegeriti ulagilagi nimwankula hangu, “Kwahera mlandu handa agu yagulonga gwankutendeka, gugulaviya hera gamweni.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Watenditi hangu su kututiriziya pawalihola, hapeni wendereyi na lihengu, hangu, kwahera lyalitendeka. Nimluwiti Mlungu gwangu panonga, “Kumbiti vinu, Gwee Mlungu, nikuluwa gumpanani makakala.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Pang'enditi ukaya kwa Shemaya, mwana gwa Delaya na mzukulu gwa Mehetabeli, yakatatilitwi ukaya kwakuyi na yakafiriwitwindiri kalawi. Kang'ambira, “Tugendi twakalififi Munumba ya Mlungu na tulitatili toziya leru pashiru wankwiza kukulaga.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Kumbiti neni nilikosiya mumoyu, “Hashi, muntu handa neni, nana toziya ya kutuga? Hashi muntu handa neni kafira kwingira Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu su mpati kuliponiziya? Nakaka hapeni ningiri Munumba nkulu ya Mlungu.”<verse eid="NEH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nivimaniti handa Mlungu kamlagalirandiri, ila kapananwa swinda na Tobia na Sanibalati kanyoweleri vidoda <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Kaweriti kapananwa swinda su kantiliziya ntendi vidoda. Kwa kutenda hangu mewalihabisiyi litawu lyangu na wantu wambeziyi.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />“Gwee, Mlungu gwangu, guwaholi Tobia na Sanibalati toziya ya galii gawatenditi, viraa gumholi Noadia mtambika mdala na watamika wamonga woseri yawafiriti wantendi neni ntiri.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lyankumalirika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Su, shibambaza shimalilikiti kunyawa mulishaka lya ishilini na mhanu lya mwezi yagushemwa Eluli. Na lihengu ali limalirikiti mulishaka lya hamsini na mbili. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Wankondu wa maisi ga pakwegera, pawapikaniriti kuwera lihengu tulimalira, watiliti na kuwona soni nentu, toziya wavimaniti nakaka kuwera lihengu ali limalilika kwa kutangwa na Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Shaka shoseri ashi, wakulu wa Wayahudi waweriti wankulemberana hamba na Tobia. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Toziya wantu wavuwa wa muisi ya Yuda waweriti pamuhera na yomberi, toziya mbili yimu Tobia kaweriti mganafu gwa Shekaniya na mwana gwa Ara. Na ya pili Yehohanani mwana gwakuyi, kaweriti kamyuga mhinga gwa Meshulamu, mwana gwa Berekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Viraa wang'ambira maheri gakatenditi Tobia na womberi wamgambiriti kila shintu shantakuliti. Na Tobiya kaweriti kankunjegera hamba zankuntiliziya.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Pashipeleritwi shibambaza kunyawiwa kayi na kutulwa migomi mikulu, wasyaguliti walolela wa migomi mikulu na wimba na Walawi na kupananwa lihengu lya kutenda. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Nimsyagula mlongu gwangu Hanani kuwera mkulu gwa Yerusalemu pamuhera na Hanania yakawera mkulu gwa liboma, toziya Hanania kaweriti muntu mwaminika na yakamguwira Mlungu kuliku wamonga wavuwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />“Niwagambira, migomi mikulu ya Yerusalemu nayivugulwa mpaka mshenji pagukwenaku. Pamberi walolera wanewuki ifiruwa migomi yoseri itatwi kwa ngwiligiziwu. Muwasyaguli wololera muwantu yawalikala ku mji gwa Yerusalemu waweri walolera, kila yumu kalikali pahala pakuyi pakalolana na numba yakuyi.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matawu ga wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Ezra 2:1-70</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Mji gwa Yerusalemu guweriti gupanuka na mkulu, kumbiti wenikaya wakuyi waweriti wadidini na kuweriti kwahera numba yazinyawitwi. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Mlungu katuliti mngati mumoyu gwangu kuwajojonila wakulu na wantu su wawalangwi kulinganira na nkolu zawu. Mpatiti shitabu sha nkolu za wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa mala ya kwanja na awa ndo yawaweriti walembwa mshitabu ashi.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Awa ndo wantu yawaweriti muuhamisiwu Babeli, wawuyiti mjini Yerusalemu na mji gwa Yuda, kila yumu kawuya kumji kwakuyi. Na walongu wawu waweriti walikala Babuloni kwanjira mfalumi Nebukadineza pakawajegiti aku waweri watatilwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Pawawuyiti walonguziyitwi na Zerubabeli na Yeshua na Nehemia na Azariya na Raamiya na Nahamani na Moridekia na Bilishani na Misipereti na Bigwai na Nehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Ayi ndo walanga ya wantu wa nkolu za Israeli yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu:<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:8" />
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:8">Paroshi waweriti wantu elufu mbili na miya yimu na sabini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:9">Shefatiya waweriti wantu miya tatu na sabini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:10">Ara waweriti wantu miya sita na hamsini na mbili <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />lukolu lwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:11">Pahati Mowabu, weni ndo wiwuka wa Yeshua na Yoabu waweriti wantu elufu mbili na miya nani na kumi na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:12">Eramu waweriti wantu elufu yimu miya mbili na hamsini na msheshi, <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:13">Zatu waweriti wantu miya nani na arobaini na mhanu, <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:14">Zakai waweriti wantu miya saba na sitini, <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:15">Binui waweriti wantu miya sita na arobaini na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:16">Bebai waweriti wantu miya sita na ishilini na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:17">Azigadi waweriti wantu elufu mbili miya tatu na ishilini na mbili <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:18">Adonikamu waweriti wantu miya sita na sitini na saba, <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:19">Bigivai waweriti wantu elufu mbili na sitini na saba, <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:20">Adini waweriti wantu miya sita na amsini na mhanu, <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:21">Ateri viravilii ushemwa Hezekia waweriti wantu tisini na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:22">Hashumu waweriti wantu miya tatu na ishilini na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:23">Bezai waweriti wantu miya tatu na ishilini na msheshi, <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:24">Harifu waweriti wantu miya yimu na kumi na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />wiwuka wa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:25">Gibeoni waweriti wantu tisina na mhanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Viraavirii wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:26" />
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:26">Betilehemu na Netofa yawawuyiti waweriti miya yimu na semanini na nani, <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:27">Anatoti waweriti miya yimu na ishilini na nani <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:28">Beti Azimaweti waweriti arubaini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:29">Kiriati Yearimu, Kefira na Beeroti waweriti miya saba na arobaini na tatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:30">Rama na Geba waweriti miya sita na ishilini na moja, <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:31">Mikimashi waweriti miya yimu na ishilini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:32">Beteli na Ai waweriti miya yimu na ishilini na tatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />wantu wa mji gumonga gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:33">Nebo waweriti hamsini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />wantu wa mji gumonga gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:34">Eramu waweriti elufu yimu miya mbili na amsini na msheshi, <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:35">Harimu waweriti miya tatu na ishilini, <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:36">Yeriko waweriti miya tatu na arobaini na mhanu, <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:37">Lodi na Hadidi na Ono waweriti miya saba na ishilini na yimu, <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />wantu wa mji gwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:38">Senaa waweriti elufu tatu miya tisa na selasini.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Ayi ndo walanga ya watambika yawawuyiti kulawa muhamisiwu. Watambika wa wiwuka wa Yedaya, kulawa lukolu lwa Yeshua waweriti wantu miya tisa sabini na tatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:40">Imeri waweriti wantu elufu yimu na hamsini na mbili, <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:41">Pashuri waweriti wantu elufu yimu miya mbili na arobaini na saba, <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:42">Harimu waweriti wantu elufu yimu na lilongu na saba.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Walawi wa lukolu lwa</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:43">Yeshua na Kadimieli na wiwuka wa Hodavayi yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu waweriti wantu sabini na msheshi. <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Yawimba kulawa,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:44">Wiwuka wa Asafu waweriti wantu miya yimu na arobaini na nani. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Walolera migomi mikulu</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:45">Kulawa wiwuka wa Shalumu na Ateri na Talimoni na Akubu na Hatita na Shobai waweriti wantu miya yimu selasini na nani.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Nkolu za wantumintumi wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu ziweriti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:46" />
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:46">Lukolu lwa Siha na lukolu lwa Hasufa na lukolu lwa Tobaoti.<verse eid="NEH 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Lukolu lwa Kerosi na lukolu lwa Sia na lukolu lwa Padoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lukolu lwa Lebana na lukolu lwa Hagaba na lukolu lwa Shalimai.<verse eid="NEH 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Lukolu lwa Hanani na lukolu lwa Gideli na lukolu lwa Gahari.<verse eid="NEH 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Lukolu lwa Reaya na lukolu lwa Resini na lukolu lwa Nekoda.<verse eid="NEH 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Lukolu lwa Gazamu na lukolu lwa Uza na lukolu lwa Pesea.<verse eid="NEH 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Lukolu lwa Besai na lukolu lwa Meunimu na lukolu lwa Nefushesimu.<verse eid="NEH 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Lukolu lwa Bakibuki na lukolu lwa Hakufa na lukolu lwa Halihuri.<verse eid="NEH 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Lukolu lwa Basliti na lukolu lwa Mehida na lukolu lwa Harisha.<verse eid="NEH 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Lukolu lwa Balikosi na lukolu lwa Sisera na lukolu lwa Tema.<verse eid="NEH 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Lukolu lwa Neziya na lukolu lwa Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Nkolu za wantumintumi wa mfalumi Selemani yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu ziweriti azi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:57" />
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:57">Lukolu lwa Sotai na lukolu lwa Sofereti na lukolu lwa Perida.<verse eid="NEH 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Lukolu lwa Yaala na lukolu lwa Darikoni na lukolu lwa Gideli.<verse eid="NEH 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Lukolu lwa Shefatia na lukolu lwa Hatili na lukolu lwa Pokereti Hasebaimu na lukolu lwa Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Su wantumintumi woseri wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wantumintumi wa Selemani, waweriti wantu miya tatu tisini na mbili.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Awa ndo wantu yawawuyiti kulawa miji ya Teli Mela na Teli Harisha na Kerubu na Adoni na Imeri, kumbiti walilanguziyandiri handa womberi walawira muwiwuka wa Israeli. <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Wiwuka wa Delaya na wiwuka wa Tobayi na wiwuka wa Nekoda waweriti wantu miya sita na arobaini na mbili.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Azi ndo nkolu za watambika yawawuti kulawa muuhamisiwu waweriti: Lukolu lwa Hobaya na lukolu lwa Hakozi na lukolu lwa Barizilai muntu yakaweriti kamyuga mhinga gwa Barizilai muntu yakalawira Gileadi na yomberi kashemwa kwa litawu lya lukolu alu. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Awa wasakuliti matawu gawu mumaholu ga nkolu zawu kumbiti wawonekandiri, hangu wajimirwandiri kuwera watambika toziya wawoneka kuwera wajimirika ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Hangu Mkolamlima kawalagalira kuwera namliya shiboga yashilaviyitwi kwa Mlungu, mpaka pakasoka mtambika yakamuwa kwa kutendera mabuwi yagashemwa Urimu na Tumimu.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Walanga ya wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu waweriti elufu arobaini na mbili miya tatu na sitini. <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Viravilii waweriti na wantumintumi wawu</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:67">Wapalu na wadala elufu saba miya tatu na selasini na saba,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:67">Na kuweriti na yawimba wapalu na wadala miya mbili na arobaini na mhanu. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Wawuyiti na</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:68">Farasi miya saba na selasini na sita na</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:68">Punda farasi miya mbili na arobaini na mhanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:68" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Ngamiya miya msheshi na selasini na mhanu na</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 7:69">Punda waweriti Elufu sita miya saba na ishilini.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Wamu wa wakulu wa nkolu walaviyiti vintu vya kunyawira Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Mkolamlima gwa lukolu kalaviya kilu elufu yimu za zahabu na mabakuli amusini na nguwu za watambika miya tanu na selasini. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Wamu wa wakulu wa nkolu walaviya kilu miya yimu na sitini na nani za zahabu na kilu elufu yimu miya mbili na hamsini za madini ga feza. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Vintu vyoseri vyawalaviyiti wantu wamonga viweriti kilu elufu ishilini za zahabu na kilu elufu mbili za madini ga feza na nguwu za watambika sitini na saba.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Hangu watambika na Walawi na walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wimba na wamu wa wantu wamonga na wantumintumi wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wantu woseri wa Israeli, walikaliti mumiji yawu.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezra kankuwabetulira wantu lagiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Pagusokiti mwezi gwa saba wantu woseri wa Israeli waweriti walikala kala mukaya mwawu. Shakapanu wantu woseri, wajojonika pamuhera kumji gwa Yerusalemu pakwegera na Ligomi likulu lya Mashi. Wamgambira Ezra yakamana lagiru kajegi shitabu sha lagiru lya Musa, Mtuwa Mlungu shakawalagaliriti Waisraeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Hangu mtambika Ezra, kagenda na kushijega shitabu sha lagiru, kashijegiti kulongolu kulijojonika lyoseri, wapalu kwa wadala, kila yumu yakaweriti na uwezu wa kupikaniliti lagiru ali. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Ezra kawasomeri lagiru lya Musa kulongolu kuluwaga lwaluwera kulongolu kuligomi likulu lwa mashi kulawa mandawira mpaka paluwala. Wantu woseri waweriti kala kupikinira shitabu sha lagiru.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Mlemba Ezra kagoloka panani pa shintambi sha mitera yashinyawitwi kwa toziya ayi. Pakwegera na yomberi uwega wa kumliwu kagolokiti Matitiya na Shema na Anaya na Uria na Hilikia na Maaseya. Uwega wakuyi wa kumshigi kagolokiti Pedaya na Mishaeli na Milikia na Hashumu na Hashibadani na Zekariya na Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ezra kagolokiti panani pa shintambi sha mtera na wantu woseri pawamlola, pakashivuguliti shitabu shilii sha lagiru, wantu woseri wagoloka. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ezra kalonga, “Gukwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu Mkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 8:6">Wantu woseri wanyasula mawoku gawu na kwitikira “Yina! Yina!” Shakapanu wamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu agawu wasuntamala pasi.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Shakapanu wansuntamala na kugoloka pahala pawu, walawi awa wawatangiti wantu kuzimana weri lagiru. Walawi awa waweriti Yeshua na Bani na Sherebia na Yamini na Akubu na Shabetai na Hodia na Maaseya na Keliti na Azaria na Yozabadi na Hanani na Pelaya. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Wasomiti weri lagiru za Mlungu na wawagambiziyiti wantu kwa njira yeni wantu woseri mewawezi kushimana.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Wantu pawapikaniliti lagiru, ziwingiriti mumiyoyu yawu, wantu woseri wanjiti kulira. Hangu Nehemiya yakaweriti mkolamlima na Ezra mtambika na mlemba, pamuhera na Walawi wawafunditi wantu na wawagambiriti wantu woseri, “Lishaka ali ndo lishaka linanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, namdaya na kulira. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nehemia kalonga, Mgendi mwakaliyi shiboga shiherepa na mlandi yashiwera shinoga na mmupanani ulii yakahera shintu toziya leru ndo lishaka linanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Namhinginika, toziya nemeru yakakupananani Mtuwa Mlungu hayiwapanani makakala.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Hangu Walawi wawagendiriti na wawagambira wantu waleleki kulira, “Toziya lishaka lya leru ndo linanagala nawahinginika.” <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Shakapanu Wantu woseri wawuya ukaya kwawu kuliya na kulanda, agawu pawanemelera na kuwabagulira shiboga wamonga toziya wagamaniti goseri gawagambilitwi.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa visasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Shilawu yakuyi, wakulu wa nkolu pamuhera na Watambika na Walawi wajojonika kwa Ezra, su walifundi lagiru. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Wayambuliti handa, ilembwa mushitabu sha lagiru sheni Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti Musa, handa wantu wa Israeli wafiruwa kulikala muvisasa vyawu mumsambu gwa mwezi ga saba. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Hangu wabwera mumji yawu yoseri na aku Yerusalemu, pawalonga, “Mgendi muvigongu na muwuyi na ntambi za mizeyituni na mizeyituni ya kuntundu na mihadasi na mitendi na vikwambikwambi na mitela yimonga ya kunyawira visasa, ntambu yayilembitwi.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Su, wantu wagenda kujega ntambi na walinyawira visasa kila yumu mushitwiku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">shitwiku handa litala</char></note> shakuyi yashiweriti lalanda, na kuluwaga lwa numba yakuyi na kuluwaga lwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na muluwaga lwa ligomi likulu lyalishemwa lya Mashi na kuluwaga lwa Ligomi Likulu lya Efraimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muhamisiwu wanyawa visasa vyawu walikaliti amu. Ayi iweriti mala ya kwanja wantu kulikala muvisasa kwanjira shaka sha Yeshua, mwana gwa Nuni pakaweriti kalikala. Wantu wanemeleliti nentu. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Kila lishaka, kwanjila lishaka lya kwanja mpaka lya upeleru, Ezra kawasomera wantu shitabu sha lagiru lya Mlungu. Watenditi msambu agu kwa shaka sha mashaka saba na lishaka lya nani kuweriti na lijojoniku likulu lya kutata msambu, ntambu yayilagalilitwi mushitabu sha lagiru.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankulonga waleka vidoda vyawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Mulishaka lya ishilini na msheshi lya mwezi gulagulii gwa saba, wantu wa israeli wajojonikiti pamuhera, agawu pawaleka kuliya na kuvala nguwu za mafafa na kuliswaga lidikudiku mumituwi mwawu kulanguziya hinginika yawu. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Mashaka aga wiwuka awu wa Israeli walituliti gweka na wantu wayawawerandiri Wayahudi. Wagoloka pahala pawu na kulonga waleka vidoda vyawu na vidoda vya watati wawu. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Wagoloka pahala pawaweriti agawu pawasoma shitabu sha Lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu kwa masaa matatu na masaa matatu gamonga waweriti wankulonga waleka vidoda na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Walawi awa waweriti wagoloka kulukweneru, yawagolokiti waweriti Yeshua na Bani na Kadimieli na Shebania na Buni na Sherebia na Bani na Kenani. Awa wamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu kwa liziwu likulu.<verse eid="NEH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Na Walawi awa Yeshua na Kadimieli na Bani na Hashabinea na Sherebia na Hodia na Shebania na Petahia wawagambiriti wantu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Mgoloki na mumzyumi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">mumkwisi yomberi mashaka goseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Wantu walikwisi litawu lyakuyi linanagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">lyaliwera liheri kuliku shintu shoseri shilii.”<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwa ya kulekeziwa vidoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ezra kamluwa Mlungu pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">“Gwenga gwekayaku ndo Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">Gwenga ndo yagunyawa mpindi na vyoseri vyaviwera amu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">bahari na vyoseri yaviwera amu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">gwenga ndo yaguvitula ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">na yawawera kumpindi wankukuguwira gwenga.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Gwenga ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, yagumsyaguliti Abramu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">na kumlaviya kulawa Uri ya Wakalidayu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">na yagumpaniti litawu lya Abrahamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Gwenga gumwona kuwera mwaminika kwaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na gwenga gutenda lipatanu na yomberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na kuwapanana wazyukulu wakuyi isi ya Wakanaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na Wahiti na Waamori</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na Waperizi na Wayebusi na Wagirigashi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Gutenda shagulongiti toziya gwenga gwaminika.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />Guwoniti ntabiku ya wambuyi wetu yawalikaliti aku Misri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">gupikinira kulira kwawu kubahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Gutenditi lilangaliru na makangashu kwa Farao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">wantumintumi wakuyi woseri na wantu woseri wa isi yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">toziya guvimaniti kuwera ntambu yawawatibisiyiti wambuyi wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">Na kulitenda gwenga gamweni gumaniki mpaka leru.<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Guyibagula bahari kulongolu kwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">na womberi wapita pakati pa bahari, pahala payuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">Na walii yawawafatiti kuwadibisiyiti mumashi matali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">handa libuwi lizotopa ntambu yalilidiba mmashi gavuwa.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Paluwala guwalongoziyiti kwa lupanda lwa liwundi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">na pashiru guwalongoziyiti kwa lupanda lwa motu su kuwamilikira munjira yakupiyira.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Kulii kulugongu Sinai gusulukiti kulawa kumpindi na kuyowera nawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">Guwapanana malagalira gaherepa na lagiru yazifiruwa na za nakaka.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Kupitira ntumintumi gwaku Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">gulitenda Lishaka lyaku lya Koyera limanikani na womberi na guwalagaliriti wagafati malagalira na lagiru zaguwagambiriti.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Pawaweriti na njala, guwapananiti shiboga kulawa kumpindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Pawayumiruwiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">guwapananiti mashi kulawa kulitalawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Guwagambiriti kuyitola isi yaguweriti guwapanani.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Kumbiti womberi na wambuyi wetu wawera na mtiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">na wawera wankesela walema kufata malagiru gaku.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Walema kupikanira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">na walyaluwa goseri gagutenditi na mauzauza gagugatenditi muwamu mwawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Wawera wankesela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">na kwa mtiti gwawu wamsyagula mlonguziya gwawu su wawuyi Misri isi ya umanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Kumbiti gwenga ndo Mlungu yagulekeziya na gwana manemu na lusungu lutangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">gukalalandiri kalongola na ndo gwana ufiru utangala, na gwenga guwalekandiri.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Ata pawalinyawiriti shinyagu sha ng'ombi mdidini na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">ayu ndo Mlungu gwetu yakatulaviyiti kulawa isi ya Misri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">vinu wakwigiriti gwenga.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Toziya gwenga gwana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">lusungu lutangala guwalekandiri kushiwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">Lupanda lwa liwundu lulekandiri kuwalonguziya munjira yawu paluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">pota lupanda lwa motu lulekandiri kuwamulikira pashiru njira yawafiruwitwi kuyipitira.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Guwapanana Rohu gwaku muheri su kuwafunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">guwapanana mana kuwera shiboga shawu na mashi ga kulanda su kunyamaziya nyumiruwa zawu.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Kwa vinja alubaini guwalolera kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">guwapananiti kila shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">nguwu zawu zisakalandiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">magulu gawu pota kuvimba.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Guwatenditi wakanki na kuwapanana falumi na isi zimonga zazipakaniti nawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">paguwabagulira mpaka isi zaziweriti kutali nentu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">Wayitola isi yakakolitimlima Sihoni mfalumi gwa Heshiboni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na isi ya kakolitimlima Bashani mfalumi gwa Ogu.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Guwatenda waweri wavuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">handa ntondu za kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">guwalonguziya muisi yaguwagambilaga wambuyi wawu haguwapanani.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Hangu, wiwuka awu wiza na kuyitola isi ya Kanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">na wawakankiti Wakanaani yawaweriti wenikaya wa isi ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">Wakanaani wawatula mumawoku mwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">pamuhera na wafalumi wawu na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">wantu wawu na isi yawu su wantu wa Israeli wawatendi ntambu yawafira.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Walopoliti maboma na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">litapaka lyana mbotu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">numba zyana vintu vivuwa viherepa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na manegu yagabawitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">malambu ga mizabibu na mizeyituni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">pamuhera na mitera yana mabwajubwaju gavuwa. Hangu waliya na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">kwikuta na kunenepera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na kunemelera vintu vyoseri vyaguwapananiti.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Kumbiti wakupikanirandiri na wakulema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">na walekiti lagiru zaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Wawalaga wambuyi waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">yawawaberiziyiti su wakuwuyiri gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">na wakwigiriti gwenga nentu.<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Hangu guwaleka wakomangwi na wankondu wawu, yawawatabisiyiti ng'anji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Pawaweriti wankutabika wakulilira gwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">na gwenga gupikanira kulira kwa womberi kulawa kumpindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Na guwawoneriti lusungu nentu, guwajegela wantu wa kuwalopola kulawa kwa wankondu wawu,<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Kumbiti pawaweriti na ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">wakutenderiti kayi makontola agawu gwenga paguwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Na gwenga guwalekiti mumawoku mwa wankondu wawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">su wawakolimlima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Pawakuliliti kayi, gwenga gupikaniriti kulawa kumpindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Na kwa lusungu lwaku guwalopola mala zitangala.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Guwakalapira su wajimiri lagiru zaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Kumbiti kwa mtiti gwawu, walekiti kujimira malagaliru gaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Tembera geni gamtenda muntu kaweri na makaliru maheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Womberi waweriti na mtiti na walemiti kukupikanira.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Guwahepelera kwa vinja vivuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">na kuwabeziya kwa njira ya rohu kupitira wambuyi waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">kumbiti walishelandiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Hangu guwaleka wabatwi na wantu wa isi za pakwegera.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Kumbiti kwa lusungu lwaku lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">guwalekandiri watenduwi nakamu ama kwaswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:31">toziya gwenga ndo Mlungu gwana manemu na lusungu.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />Vinu gwee, Mlungu gwetu, Mlungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">yagwana makakala na yagutiliziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">gwenga gulikola lipatanu lyaku lya ufiru uvuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">Nagulyaluwa ntabiku zyazitupatiti twenga na wafalumi wetu na wakulu wetu na watambika wetu na wambuyi wetu na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">wazewi wetu na wantu waku woseri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kwanjira shaka sha wafalumi wa Ashuru mpaka leru.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Kumbiti ntabiku zoseri zyazitupatiti, guwera gwana nfiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">gwee gwa mwaminika, agawu twenga tutenda vidoda.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Wafalumi wetu, wakulu wetu, watambika wetu na wazewi wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">wakolandiri lagiru zaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">watendandiri lagiru zaku pota makalapiru yaguwapananiti.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Wakutenderandiri muufalumi wawu, pota pawaganemeleriti maheri gaku gaguwapananiti kwa uvuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">muisi nkulu na litapaka lyana mbotu yaguwapananiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">kumbiti walemiti kukutendera na kuleka makontola.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Vinu guloli, leru twenga ndo wamanda, wamanda muisi yaguwapananiti wazewi wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">Isi yana mbotu.<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Toziya ya vidoda vyatutenditi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">mabenangu gakuyi gavuwa gagenda kwa wafalumi yaguwatuliti watukolimlima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Vilavilii wakolamlima mifugu yetu ntambu yawafira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">Twamuntabiku nkulu!”<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wankujimira lipatanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />“Kwa goseri aga, yagatulawiriti twenga wantu wa Israeli tutuliti lipatanu ligangamala lya malembu pamuhera na wakulu wetu na Walawi wetu na watambika wetu pawatula vimaniziya vyawu.”<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Awa ndo watambika yawatuliti vimaniziya muhamba, gwa kwanja Nehemia mwana gwa Hakalia shakapanu Sedekia,<verse eid="NEH 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Seraya na Azaria na Yeremia,<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pashuri na Amaria na Malikiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatushi na Shebaniya na Maluki,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harimu na Meremoti na Obadia,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Danieli na Ginetoni na Baruku,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshulamu na Abiya na Miyamini,<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maaziya na Biligai na Shemaya. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Na Walawi waweriti ndo,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:9">Yeshua na mwana gwa Azania</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:9">Na Binui gwa wiwuka wa Henadadi</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:9">Na Kadimieli. <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Na walawi wayawu yawatuliti saini ndo. Shebania na Hodia</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:10">Kelita na Pelaya na Hanani,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika na Rehobu na Hashabia,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuri na Sherebiya na Shebania,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia na Bani na Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Matawu ga walonguziya wa wantu gaweriti,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:14">Paroshi na Pahati Mowabu</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:14">Eramu na Zatu na Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni na Azigadi na Bebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya na Bigivai na Adini,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateri na Hezekia na Azuri,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodai na Hashumu na Bezai,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harifu na Anatoti na Nebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiashi na Meshulamu na Heziri,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeli na Sadoki na Yadua,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Palatia na Hanani na Anaya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea na Hananiya na Hashubu,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheshi na Piliha na Shobeki,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehumu na Hashabina na Maaseya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahia na Hanani na Anani,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki, Harimu na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankutenda majimiranu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Wantu yawasigaliti na watambika na walawi na walolera migomi na wimba na wantumintumi wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na wantu woseri yawalitula gweka na wantu wa isi za pakwegera, su wajimiri lagiru lya Mlungu pamuhera na wadala wawu na wana wawu na wahinga wawu na woseri yawaweriti na umani na luhala, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />tuweriti shintu shimu na walongu wawu na wakulu wawu, na tulilapa kuwera hatufati lagiru lya Mlungu lyalilaviyitwi kupitira Musa ntumintumi gwa Mlungu. Na hatukoli lagiru na matakulu goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mtuwa gwetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Wahinga wetu hapeni tuwayugiziyi kwa wantu wa maisi aga na pota wantemba wetu wapalu hapeni wayugi wahinga wawu.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Payiwera wantu wa maisi gamonga wankujega vintu ama shiboga kushuwuza lishaka lya kwoyera, twenga hapani twehemeri lishaka ali pota lishaka limonga lyoseri lyaliwera linanagala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:31">Kila shinja sha saba hapeni tulimi pota kuwashonga wantu.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Tulitulira lagiru lya kulaviya gramu msheshi za madini ga feza kila shinja toziya ya kulolera Numba nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Viraavirii hatulaviyi mabumunda mananagala na tambiku za viboga na tambiku za kulunguziwa na tambiku za lishaka lya kwoyela na misambu ya mwezi kulawa na misambu imonga yayitulitwi na vintu vimonga vinanangala na tambiku za kuwusiya vidoda, su kuwakolaniziya wantu wa Israeli na kwa mahengu goseri ga Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Twenga na wantu woseri na watambika na Walawi tugalambuliti simbi su tuvimana lukolu loshi halujegi mbawu za kulunguziwa tambiku mushitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, ntambu yayilembitwi mulagiru.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Twankulonga kila shinja hatujegi viboga vya kwanja vya kubenanga na mabwajubwaju ga kwanja ga kwapa hatugajegeri kunumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Ntambu yayilembitwi mulagiru, hatuwajegi wiwuka wetu wa kwanja washipalu munumba zyetu kwa watambika yawatenda lihengu amu su wapungwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Vilavilii hatujegi wiwuka wa kwanja wa ng'ombi wetu na wakondolu wetu na wambuzi wetu,<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Vilavilii hatujegi kwa Watambika viboga vya kwanja vya mabenangu na viboga vya kwanja vya malambu getu na tambiku zyetu za viboga na mabwajubwaju ga mitera yetu yoseri na divayi yetu yasyayi na lipaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:37">Na hatujegi lifungu lya lilongu lya viboga vyetu kwa Walawi toziya womberi ndo yawasyaguliti wapiti muvijiji vyetu watoli mafungu aga ga lilongu. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Mtambika, mwiwuka gwa Aroni, hakaweri na Walawi pawanka mafungu aga ga lilongu. Shakapanu Walawi hawajegi seemu yalifungu lya lilongu lyalilaviwitwi hawapapi na kutula muvyumba vya kutulira vintu vya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Wantu wa Israeli na Walawi hawagajegi malaviwu ga viboga na divai na lipaki lya zeituni kuvyumba vyavilikala vintu vinanagala na walolera migomi mikulu na wimba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">Na mashaka goseri hapatuyilyaluwi numba ya Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawalikaliti Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Shakapanu, wakulu wa wantu yawalikaliti kumji gwa Yerusalemu na wantu wamonga, wagalambuliti simbi na muntu yumu pakati pa wantu lilongu kizi kulikala Yerusalemu, mji mnanagala na wamonga tisa yawasigaliti waweriti walikali mumiji yawu weni. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Wantu wawazyuma woseri walii yawafiriti weni kulikala Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Ata hangu mumiji yimonga wantu wamonga wa Israeli na watambika na Walawi na walolera na wiwuka wa wantumintumi wa Selemani wendereyiti kulikala muisi zawu na kila yumu pahala pakuyi mweni. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Wantu wa likabila la Yuda ndo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:4">Ataya, mwana gwa Uzia na mzukulu gwa Zekaria. Wazewi wamonga ndo Amaria na Mahalaleli, wiwuka wa Yuda mwana gwa Peresi.<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Viraa Maaseya yakiwukiti na Baruki na mzukulu gwa Kolihoze mwana gwakuyi Hazaya na mwana gwakuyi Adaya na mwana gwakuyi Yoyaribu na mwana gwa Zekaria, mwiwuka gwa Shela.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Wiwuka woseri wa Peresi yawalikaliti kumji gwa Yerusalemu waweriti wapalu wavikambaku miya msheshi sitini nanani. <verse eid="NEH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Benjamini yawalikaliti Yerusalemu ndo awa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:7">Salu mwana gwa Meshulamu, mwana gwa Yoedi, mwana gwa Pedaya, mwana gwa Kolaya, mwana gwa Maaseya, mwana gwa Itieli, mwana gwa Yeshaya.<verse eid="NEH 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Shakapanu waweriti Gabai na Salai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:8">Walanga yawu ndo miya tisa na ishilini nanani. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli mwana gwa Zikiri kaweriti ndo mkulu gwawu na Yuda mwana gwa Hesenuya kaweriti mkulu gwa pili gwa mji. <verse eid="NEH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Watambika yawalikaliti Yerusalemu waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:10">Yedaya mwana gwa Yoyaribu na Yakini,<verse eid="NEH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraya mwana gwa Hilikiya na mwana gwa Meshulamu na mwana gwa Sadoki na mwana gwa Merayoti na mwana gwa Ahitubu mgolokela gwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />pamuhera na walongu wawu yawatenda lihengu munumba nkulu ya Mlungu, waweriti wantu miya nani ishilini na mbili. Viraavirii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:12">kuweriti na Adaya mwana gwa Yerohamu, mwana gwa Pelaliya, mwana gwa Amzi, mwana gwa Zekaria, mwana gwa Pashuri, mwana gwa Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />Viraavirii kuweriti walongu wawu yawaweriti wakulu wa wantu wa watati wawu, woseri pamuhera waweriti wantu miya mbili na arobaini na mbili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:13">Viraavirii waweriti Amashisai mwana gwakuyi Azareli, mzukulu gwa Ahizai, mwana gwakuyi Meshilemoti, mwana gwakuyi Imeri, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />pamuhera na walongu wawu, woseri waweriti miya yimu na ishilini nanani, wantu vikambaku vya kugenda kunkondu. Na mkulu gwawu kaweriti Zabidieli mwana gwa Hegedolimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Walawi yawalikaliti kumji gwa Yerusalemu waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:15">Shemaya mwana gwa Hashubu na mwana gwa Azirikamu na mwana gwa Hashabiya na mwana gwa Buni.<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetayi na Yozabadi wakulu wawili wa Walawi, weni wagolokeliti mahengu ga kunja ga numba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataniya mwana gwa Mika, mwana gwa Zabidi, mwiwuka gwa Asafu yakaweriti mlonguziya gwa wimba, kaweriti mkulu shaka sha kuluwa kulonga mayagashi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:17">Bakibukiya kaweriti mtanga gwakuyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:17">Pamuhera na awa kaweriti Abida, mwana gwa Shamuwa, mwana gwa Galali mwiwuka gwa Yedutuni.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Walawi woseri yawalikaliti kumji gwa Yerusalemu, mji mnanagala waweriti miya mbili na semanini na msheshi. <verse eid="NEH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Walolela wa migomi mikulu yawalikaliti Yerusalemu waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:19">Akubu na Talimoni na walongu wawu yawaloleriti migomi mikulu, waweriti miya yimu na sabini na mbili.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Waisraeli yawasigaliti, pamuhera na watambika na Walawi yawalikaliti muisi ya Yuda, kila yumu kalikala pahala pakuyi pakabaguliritwi na tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Kumbiti wantumintumi wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu walikaliti Yerusalemu pahala papashemitwi Ofeli waweriti pasi pa ugolokera wa Ziha na Gishipa.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Mkulu gwa Walawi yakalikaliti Yerusalemu kaweriti Uzi mwana gwa Bani mzukulu gwa Hashabiya. Wambuyi wakuyi waweriti Mataniya na Mika, woseri awa waweriti wa lukolu lwa Asafu, lukolu lweni luweriti lwankulaviya tendera ya kwimba mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Kuweriti na lagiru kulawa kwa mfalumi lyalilonguziya lukolu loshi halutola shipindi sha kwimba Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu kila lishaka.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahia mwana gwa Meshezabeli, yumu gwa wiwuka wa Zera gwa likabila lya Yuda, kaweriti mtakulila gwa wantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa miji mimonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Wantu wamonga walikala mumji ya yapakwegera na malambu gawu. Wantu muwa wa likabila lya Yuda walikaliti Kiriati Ariba na Diboni na Yekabizeeli pamuhera na vijiji vyaviwera pakwegera miji ayi. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Wamonga walikaliti mumiji ya Yeshua na Molada na Beti Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Hazari Shuali na Beeri Sheba na vijiji vyawawazyengekiti miji ayi. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Wamonga walikaliti mumji gwa Zakilagi na Mekona na vijiji vyaviwazengeta. <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Wamonga waweriti mumiji ya Eni Rimoni na Sora na Yarimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zanoa na Adulamu pamuhera na vijiji vyaviyizengeta miji ayi, mu Lakishi na malambu gakuyi na mu Azeka pamuhera na vijiji vyaviwazengeta miji ayi. Hangu ilanguziya kuwera wantu wa Yuda walikiti pakati pa Beeri Sheba mpaka lulalanda lwa Hinomu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walikaliti Geba na Makimashi na Ai na Beteli na vijiji vyaviwazengeta mji agu. <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Wamonga walikaliti Anatoti na Nobu na Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazori na Rama na Gitaimu, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadadi na Seboimu na Nebalati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lodi na Ono lyaliweriti mululalanda lwa wanyawa vintu. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Walawi wamonga wa Yuda walikaliti pamuhera na likabila lya Benjamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Ayi ndo walanga ya watambika na Walawi yawawuyiti kulawa kuuhamisiwu pamuhera na Zerubaberi mwana gwa Shealitieli na Yeshua,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraya na Yeremia na Ezra,<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria na Maluki na Hatushi, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekania na Rehumu na Meremoti, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido na Ginetoni na Abiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamini na Moadiya na Biliga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya na Yoyaribu na Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu na Amoki na Hilikia na Yedaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:7">Awa waweriti wakulu wa watambika na walongu wawu shaka sha Yeshua. <verse eid="NEH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Awa ndo Walawi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:8">Yeshua na Binui na Kadimieli na Sherebia na Yuda, viraa Mataniya mweni kaweriti mgolokera gwa nyimbu za kulonga mayagashi pakatagwa na walongu wakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakibukia na Uno na walawi wayawu, wagoloka pakwegera nawa pawawimba na kwitikira.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Mtambika mkulu Yeshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yeshua kamwiwuliti Yoyakimu na Yoyakimu kamwiwuliti Eliashibu na Eliyashibu kamwiwuliti Yoyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada kamwiwuliti Yonatani na Yonatani kamwiwuliti Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa nkolu za Watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yoyakimu pakaweriti mtambika mkulu, watambika waweriti wakulu wa nkolu zawu. Lukolu lwa Seraya kaweriti Meraya na lukolu lwa Yeremia kaweriti Hanania <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulamu kulawa lukolu lwa Ezra na Yehohanani kulawa lukolu lwa Amaria, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Yonatani kulawa lukolu lwa Maluki na Yosefu kulawa lukolu lwa Shekania kaweriti, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adina kulawa lukolu lwa Harimu na Helikai kulawa lukolu lwa Merayoti, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zekaria kulawa lukolu lwa Ido na Geshulamu kulawa lukolu lwa Ginetoni <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikiri kulawa lukolu lwa Abiya na lukolu lwa Miniamini kuweritindiri na litawu lya muntu na lukolu lwa Maazia kaweriti Pilitai, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Shamua kulawa lukolu lwa Biliga na Yehonatani kulawa lukolu lwa Shemaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenai kulawa lukolu lwa Yoyaribu na Uzi kulawa lukolu lwa Yedaya <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalai kulawa lukolu lwa Salu na Eberi kulawa lukolu lwa Amoki <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Heshabai kulawa lukolu lwa Hilikia na Netaneli kulawa lukolu lwa Yedaya.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya za Watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Shaka sha Eliyashibu, Yoyada, Yohanani na Yadua, wakulu wa nkolu za Walawi matawu gawu galembitwi mushitabu, viraavirii shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Dariu na wakulu wa watambika matawu gawu galembitwi mushitabu.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Wakulu wa kaya ya Lawi walembitwi mu shitabu sha maholu mpaka shaka sha Yohanani mzukulu gwa Eliyashibu.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwankana lihengu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Wakulu wa Walawi waweriti. Hashabia na Sherebia, Yeshua mwana gwa Kadimieli na wamonga wayaweriti walibagulana muvipinga viwili, Vipinga viwili avi vigoloka pavilolana na wayawu, agawu pawimba kwa kwankana nyimbu za kumzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu na kulonga maya gashi ntambu yakalagaliriti Dawudi muntu gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Walolera yawaweriti wankulolera numba za kutulira vintu palii Paligomi ndo: Matani na Bakibukia na Obadia na Meshulamu na Talmoni na Akubu.<verse eid="NEH 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Wantu awa watenditi lihengu shaka sha Yoyakimu mwana gwa Yeshua na mzukulu gwa Yosadaki na mumashaka ga Nehemia yakaweriti mkolamlima gwa isi na shaka sha Ezra mtambika na muntu yakamana Lagiru.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia kankushipunga shibambaza Sha Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Shaka sha kushipunga shibambaza sha Yerusalemu, Walawi wasakulitwi kila pahala pawalikaliti su kwiza kunemelera kwa sheleku kushipunga shibambaza, pamuhera na kulonga mayagashii na nyimbu, pawatendera matowazi na vinubi na zeze. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Viraavirii yawimba walijojonira pamuhera kulawa pahala gagazyengeta Yerusalemu na vijiji vya Wanetofati, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />viraa kulawa Beti Giligali na kulawa pahala la Geba na Azimaweti toziya yawimba waweriti walinyawira vijiji kuzyengeta Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Watambika na Walawi pawalitakasiyiti kala toziya ya kumguwila Mlungu viraavirii wawatakasiya wantu na migomi mikulu na vibambaza.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Niwalagaliriti wakulu wa Yuda wakweni pampindi pashibambaza. Vilavilii ndagaliriti vipinga viwili vikulu vyawimba wimbi nyimbu za kulonga mayagashi Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:31">Shipinga shimu shikweni uwega wa kumliwu kugendera Ligomi la Lifungusi. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Yawimba awa walilonguziyiti na Hoshaya pakawera pamuhera na nusu ya wakulu wa Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Yawafatiti kumbeli ndo Watambika yawagomba mapenka weni ndo: Azaria na Ezra na Meshulamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda na Benjamini na Shemaya na Yeremia. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Zekaria mwana gwa Yonatani, na mzukulu gwa Shemaya na mwana gwa Matania na mwana gwa Mikaya, na mwana gwa Zakuri na mwana gwa Asafu. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Pawafuwatwa walongu wakuyi, Shemaya na Azareli na Milalai na Gilalai na Maai na Netaneli na Yuda na Hanani, pawawera na vyombu vya kwimbira vya Dawudi muntu gwa Mlungu. Walongulerwa na Ezra mlemba gwa Lagiru. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Mu Ligomi la bwiru wakweniti kugenda kumji gwa Dawudi, wapititi Kuliboma lya Dawudi na kugenda kuzyetu kwa shibambaza mpaka kuligomi lya Mashi kwakulawira mshenji mwa mji.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Shipinga shimonga shashimbiti nyimbu za kulonga mayagashii shigenditi uwega wa kumshigi pampindi pa shibambaza. Neni ng'enditi na shipinga ashi pamuhera na nusu ya wantu. Tupitiriti Shindwalingu sha Tanuri mpaka ku shibambaza shipana. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Na kulawila panu, tupitiliti Ligomi la Efraimu na Ligomi la Yeshana na Ligomi likulu lya Somba na Kushindwalingu sha Hananeli na Kushindwalingu sha Mia mpaka ku Ligomi likulu lya Kondolu. Pawasokiti pa Ligomi likulu lya walolera tugolokiti.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Shakapanu, vipinga vyoseri viwili vyaviweriti vyakwimba nyimbu za kulonga mayagashii vigolokiti munumba nkulu ya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:40">pamuhera na neni na nusu ya wakulu. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Viraavirii Watambika yaweriti na mapenka waweriti: Eliyakimu na Maaseya na Miniamini na Mikaya na Eliyoenayi na Zekaria na Hanania, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Maaseya na Shemaya na Eleazari na Uzi na Yehohanani na Malikiya na Eramu na Ezeri. Awa yawimba wimbiti kwa kulonguziwa na Yezirahia.<verse eid="NEH 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Lishaka ali wantu walaviyiti tambiku zivuwa na wasekeleliti toziya Mlungu kawapananiti sheleku nkulu. Wadala na wana, wasekeleriti. Wantu wa kutali wapikiniliti wantu wa Yerusalemu pawanemelera.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matandiru toziya ya guwira Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Shaka ashi wantu wasagulitwi kuwera wagolokera wa vyumba vya kutulila vintu toziya ya mishangu na viboga vya kwanja na lifungu lilongu. Kulawa mumalambu galii yagazyengetiti miji wafiruwitwi wajegi muluhanja alu mafungu handa lagiru ntambu yayilagaliriti kwajili ya watambika na Walawi, toziya Yuda kafiriziwitwi na lihengu lya Watambika na Walawi. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Toziya wawatenderiti mirandu yakuwatenda wantu wajimirwi na kumguwira Mlungu, wimba na walolera wa ligomi likulu watenditi ntambu iraa, ntambu yakalagaliriti Dawudi na Selemani mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kwanjira shaka sha mfalumi Dawudi na yakimba Asafu, kuweriti na walonguziya wa wimba na kuweriti na nyimbu za kukwisa na kulonga mayagashii kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Waisraeli woseri, kwanjira shaka sha Zerubabeli na Nehemia, walaviyiti mafupu kila lishaka wawapananiti wimba na walolela wa migomi mikulu. Nentu ga aga wantu wa Israeli walaviyiti malaviwu toziya ya Walawi, na Walawi watula gweka lifungu lya lilongu lya vintu avi, na kuwapapana wiwuka wa Aruni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwabagula wahenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Mulishaka ali lya msambu shitabu sha lagiru lya Musa shibetulitwi kwa liziwu likulu agawu wantu woseri pawapikanira. Amu iwonekaniti ilembwa handa kwahera wantu wa Amoni pota wantu wa Mowabu yakafiruwitindiri kwingira mulijojoniru lya wantu wa Mlungu, <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />toziya wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti mumwanja kulawa Misri, Waamoni na wamoabu wawapananitindiri mashi na shiboga kumbiti womberi wamshemiti Balaamu kuwapangira Waisraeli, kumbiti Mlungu gwetu kagalambula pangira ayi kuwera ntekelera. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Wantu wa Israeli pawapikaniriti lagiru ali, wawabaguliti wahenga.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manyawiwu ga Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Pamberi pa lishaka lya msambu, mtambika Eliashibu kaweriti katulwa kuwera mgolokera gwa vyumba vya kutulira vintu vya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu, toziya Eliashibu kaweriti ganja gwa pakwegera na Tobiya, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Eliashabu kaweriti kampanana Tobiya shumba shikulu sheni pakwanja shiweriti shitenderwa kutulira tambiku za viboga, ubani na vyombu vya numba nkulu ya Mlungu, pamuhera na lifungu lya lilongu lya viboga, divayi ya syasyi na lipaki. Vintu vyoseri avi walagaliritwi Waisraeli kwajili ya Walawi, yawimba na walolera wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, pamuhera na malaviwu toziya ya watambika. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Kumbiti goseri aga pagaweriti gankutendeka, neni weritindiri Yerusalemu, toziya mushinja sha selesini na mbili sha kukolamlima wa Arishasasta mfalumi gwa Babeli weriti mbuya kwa mfalumi kumgambira gagalawiriti. Shakapanu nimluwiti mfalumi mbuyi kayi Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Pambuyiti Yerusalemu, moniti mlandu mkontola gwakalitenditi Eliashibu kumpanana Tobiya shumba muvyumba vya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Nkalaliti nentu nividankira kunja vyombu vyoseri vya Tobiya. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Shakapanu ntagaliriti wantu wavitakasiyi vyumba, shakapanu niviwuziyiti amu vintu vya Numba ya Mlungu, pamuhera na tambiku za viboga na utuli.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Viraavirii nyambuliti kuwera Walawi wapananitwindiri mafungu gawu, hangu Walawi woseri na yawimba yawaweriti muutenderu wawuya mumalambu gawu. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Niwakalipiliti wakulu na kuwakosiya, “Ntambu gaa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ilekwa?” Su niwashemiti woseri na nimtula kila muntu mulihengu lyakuyi. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Shakapanu, wantu woseri wa Israeli, wanjiti kayi kujega mafungu gawu ga lilongu ga ubumu na divayi na lipaki lya mizeyituni kushumba sha kutulira vintu. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Niwasyagula wantu awa waweri walolera wa vyumba vya kutulira vintu, mtambika Shelemiya na muntu yakamana Lagiru, Sadoki na Pedaya muntu gwa likabila lya Lawi kuwera mgolokera gwa shumba sha kutulira shintu na kumtula Hanani mwana gwa Zakuri, mwana gwa Mataniya, yomberi kaweri kankuwatanga, toziya wantu awa wawoneka kuwera waminika na lihengu lyawu liweriti kuwabagulira vintu walongu wawu.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Gwee, Mlungu gwangu, guholi kwa goseri aga, nagulyaluwa goseri galii gantenditi toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na toziya ya tendera yakuyi.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Mashaka aga mona wantu wa Yuda pawakama zabibu Mulishaka lya Koyera. Viraavirii wamonga waweriti wankuwapapiziya wapunda wawu ubumu, divayi, zabibu, tini na vintu vimonga vivuwa vyawajegiti Yerusalemu. Panu niwaberiziyiti nawashuhuza shintu Lishaka lya Koyera. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Wantu kulawa Tiro yawaweriti wankulikala Yerusalemu wajegiti wasomba na vintu vivuwa Yerusalemu na kuwashuwuzira wantu wa Yuda Lishaka lya Koyera. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Niwakalipiliti wakulu na wantu wa Yuda na kuwakosiya, “Ndo ukontola gaa awu yamuutenda kuligira Lishaka lya Koyera? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Hashi watati wenu watenditindiri mirandu ya ntambu ayi ata kumtenda Mlungu gwetu kujega ntabiku zoseri azi kwa twenga muisi ayi? Vinu mwankali mwankujega maya gakuyi kwa wantu wa Israeli kwa kuligiranga Lishaka lya Koyera.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Hangu niwalagaliriti migomi mikulu ya Yerusalemu itatwi pashimii Shaka sha Koyera, palii luwindu palwingira na migomi ayi ivugulwi mpaka lishaka lya Koyera palipera. Shakapanu ntula wantu wangu kumigomi mikulu su nashingiziwa shintu shoseri mulishaka lya Koyera. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Mala yimu ama mbili washuwuzi na wawuza vintu vya ntambu zoseri wagonjiti kunja kumji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Kumbiti niwaberiziyiti na kuwagambira, “Ntambu gaa mwankugonja pakwegera na shibambaza? Handa pamtenda hangu kayi, haniwakomangi.” Kwanjira shaka shilii wizitindiri kayi Lishaka lya Koyera. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Niwalagalira Walawi walipungi na wizi kuyilolera migomi mikulu su lishaka lya Koyera liweri Linanagala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Gwee Mlungu gwangu, gunholi toziya ya ali viraa na gwenga gunanguziyi ufiru waku mkulu.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Viraavirii mshaka ashi moniti Wayahudi yawayugiti wadala wa Ashidodi na Amoni na Mowabu, <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />na nusu ya wana wawu wayoweriti Kiashidodi na wasinditi kuyowera Shiyahudi kumbiti wayoweriti za wantu wamonga. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Niwakalipira na kuwapangira. Niwakomiti wamu wa wantu na kunika viri zawu. “Niwakakanika walirapi kwa litawu lwa Mlungu na kulonga, namuwayugiziya wahinga wenu kwa wana wawu, pota wahinga wawu nawayugwa na wantemba wenu pota maweni mwenga. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Hashi, mfalumi Selemani katendandiri vidoda kwa kuyuga wadala wa awa? Muisi zivuwa paweritindiri mfalumi handa yomberi. Na Mlungu kamfiriti nentu na kamsyaguliti kuwera mfalumi kwa Israeli yoseri, kumbiti wadala wa maisi gamonga wamtenditi katendi vidoda. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Hashi, tuwafati mwenga yamumtenderiti vidoda Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu kwa kuyuga wadala wa shihenga?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Yumu gwa wana wa Yoyada, mwana gwa Eliashibu mtambika mkulu kamyugiti mhinga gwa Sanibalati yakalawiti Botihoroni, toziya ayi nimwingiti Yoyada kawuki Yerusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Gwee Mlungu gwangu, guwaholi toziya watula uhumba utambika na lipatanu lya watambika na lya Walawi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Hangu niwapungiti watambika na Walawi kulawirana na shoseri yashiweriti sha shihenga, shakapanu ntantiti malonguziya na niwapanana Watambika na Walawi su kila yumu katendi mahengu gakuyi. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Shakapanu ndagaliriti wantu wajegi mbawu mushaka shashifiruwa na malaviwu ga ubumu wa kwanja na mabwajubwaju ga kwanja mushaka shakuyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Gwee Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu guliholi goseri aga su guntenderi maheri.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>